kin' </span><span begin="00:30.610" end="00:32.260">love</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.290" end="00:35.380"><span begin="00:32.290" end="00:32.740">Baby</span><span begin="00:32.740" end="00:32.740">, </span><span begin="00:32.740" end="00:33.190">tell </span><span begin="00:33.190" end="00:33.580">me</span><span begin="00:33.580" end="00:33.610">, </span><span begin="00:33.610" end="00:34.060">tell </span><span begin="00:34.060" end="00:35.380">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.380" end="00:38.110"><span begin="00:35.380" end="00:35.530">Who</span><span begin="00:35.530" end="00:35.530">, </span><span begin="00:35.530" end="00:35.920">who </span><span begin="00:35.920" end="00:36.130">do </span><span begin="00:36.130" end="00:36.250">you </span><span begin="00:36.250" end="00:36.790">love</span><span begin="00:36.790" end="00:36.790">, </span><span begin="00:36.790" end="00:37.000">do </span><span begin="00:37.000" end="00:37.060">you </span><span begin="00:37.060" end="00:37.420">love </span><span begin="00:37.420" end="00:38.050">now</span><span begin="00:38.050" end="00:38.110">?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.110" end="00:40.480"><span begin="00:38.110" end="00:38.350">I </span><span begin="00:38.350" end="00:38.710">wanna </span><span begin="00:38.710" end="00:39.160">know </span><span begin="00:39.160" end="00:39.310">the </span><span begin="00:39.310" end="00:40.480">truth</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.350" end="00:44.950"><span begin="00:41.350" end="00:42.190">Who</span><span begin="00:42.190" end="00:42.190">, </span><span begin="00:42.190" end="00:42.790">who </span><span begin="00:42.790" end="00:42.970">do </span><span begin="00:42.970" end="00:43.090">you </span><span begin="00:43.090" end="00:43.660">love</span><span begin="00:43.660" end="00:43.660">, </span><span begin="00:43.660" end="00:43.780">do </span><span begin="00:43.780" end="00:43.930">you </span><span begin="00:43.930" end="00:44.290">love </span